{"graph_chars": "Good morning. I am Professor Yuna Cho, and this is Chapter One of Principles of Macroeconomics, OpenStax, third edition. The chapter is titled Welcome to Economics. We stay with this chapter only: scarcity, division of labor, micro versus macro, models especially the circular flow, economic systems, FRED, and globalization. The opening case is about decisions under imperfect information in an age of social media. Economists treat information as incomplete, yet people still make hundreds of decisions each day. Markets are affected by how well and how fast information moves. To post or not to post is an economic decision, because every choice uses scarce time.", "graph_times": [[0.0, 0.0675], [0.0675, 0.1349], [0.1349, 0.2024], [0.2024, 0.2698], [0.2698, 0.3373], [0.3373, 0.4048], [0.4048, 0.4722], [0.4722, 0.5397], [0.5397, 0.6072], [0.6072, 0.6746], [0.6746, 0.7421], [0.7421, 0.8095], [0.8095, 0.877], [0.877, 0.9445], [0.9445, 1.0119], [1.0119, 1.0794], [1.0794, 1.1469], [1.1469, 1.2143], [1.2143, 1.2818], [1.2818, 1.3492], [1.3492, 1.4167], [1.4167, 1.4842], [1.4842, 1.5516], [1.5516, 1.6191], [1.6191, 1.6866], [1.6866, 1.754], [1.754, 1.8215], [1.8215, 1.8889], [1.8889, 1.9564], [1.9564, 2.0239], [2.0239, 2.0913], [2.0913, 2.1588], [2.1588, 2.2263], [2.2263, 2.2937], [2.2937, 2.3612], [2.3612, 2.4286], [2.4286, 2.4961], [2.4961, 2.5636], [2.5636, 2.631], [2.631, 2.6985], [2.6985, 2.766], [2.766, 2.8334], [2.8334, 2.9009], [2.9009, 2.9683], [2.9683, 3.0358], [3.0358, 3.1033], [3.1033, 3.1707], [3.1707, 3.2382], [3.2382, 3.3057], [3.3057, 3.3731], [3.3731, 3.4406], [3.4406, 3.508], [3.508, 3.5755], [3.5755, 3.643], [3.643, 3.7104], [3.7104, 3.7779], [3.7779, 3.8454], [3.8454, 3.9128], [3.9128, 3.9803], [3.9803, 4.0477], [4.0477, 4.1152], [4.1152, 4.1827], [4.1827, 4.2501], [4.2501, 4.3176], [4.3176, 4.3851], [4.3851, 4.4525], [4.4525, 4.52], [4.52, 4.5874], [4.5874, 4.6549], [4.6549, 4.7224], [4.7224, 4.7898], [4.7898, 4.8573], [4.8573, 4.9248], [4.